<title>POLAND: KRAKCHEMIA JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>KRAKCHEMIA JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
